msgid "event.blackout.name"
msgstr "Large-scale blackout"

msgid "event.blackout.text"
msgstr "In the middle of the energy crisis, power fails in several lands for hours. Everyone asks: more wind power – or less?"

msgid "event.bridge_closed.name"
msgstr "Motorway bridge closed"

msgid "event.bridge_closed.text"
msgstr "A crumbling motorway bridge has to be closed, commuters are stuck in traffic for hours. Invest with borrowed money – or keep the debt brake?"

msgid "event.century_flood.name"
msgstr "Flood of the century"

msgid "event.century_flood.text"
msgstr "Rivers burst their banks, whole villages are under water. Experts call for more room for floodplains and moors."

msgid "event.craft_tax_burden.name"
msgstr "Crafts complain about tax burden"

msgid "event.craft_tax_burden.text"
msgstr "The chambers of crafts in the South warn: high taxes and levies drive businesses to give up."

msgid "event.farmer_blockades.name"
msgstr "Farmers block motorways"

msgid "event.farmer_blockades.text"
msgstr "With tractors, farmers bring traffic to a halt, protesting against new environmental rules. Organic or conventional farming – what does the party stand for?"

msgid "event.fleet_limits.name"
msgstr "Stricter fleet limits"

msgid "event.fleet_limits.text"
msgstr "The EU tightens the limits for new cars. Should the combustion engine ban be fixed?"

msgid "event.food_banks.name"
msgstr "Food banks at their limit"

msgid "event.food_banks.text"
msgstr "For the first time, food banks have to turn people in need away. Must the welfare state be expanded?"

msgid "event.forest_dieback.name"
msgstr "Forest dieback after a drought summer"

msgid "event.forest_dieback.text"
msgstr "After the third drought summer, entire forests in the South are dying. Must nature conservation be strengthened?"

msgid "event.grid_standstill.name"
msgstr "Wind turbines standing still"

msgid "event.grid_standstill.text"
msgstr "Because power lines are missing, wind turbines have to be switched off in storms while the South buys expensive electricity. Where does the party stand on wind power?"

msgid "event.heating_bills.name"
msgstr "Heating cost shock"

msgid "event.heating_bills.text"
msgstr "The energy crisis hits the utility bills. Many households do not know how to pay."

msgid "event.inheritance_tax_ruling.name"
msgstr "Ruling on inheritance tax"

msgid "event.inheritance_tax_ruling.text"
msgstr "A court ruling forces a new inheritance tax rule for family businesses. Should taxes be cut?"

msgid "event.nitrate_wells.name"
msgstr "Nitrate in the groundwater"

msgid "event.nitrate_wells.text"
msgstr "In the North, drinking water wells have to be closed because of too much nitrate. The environment agency sees farming as the cause."

msgid "event.pension_alarm.name"
msgstr "Pension fund raises the alarm"

msgid "event.pension_alarm.text"
msgstr "Pension insurance warns of rising contributions or falling pensions. More welfare state or less?"

msgid "event.rating_warning.name"
msgstr "Rating agency warns"

msgid "event.rating_warning.text"
msgstr "In the middle of the financial crisis, a rating agency threatens a downgrade. Must the debt brake be kept at all costs?"

msgid "event.rent_demonstration.name"
msgstr "Mass demonstration against rents"

msgid "event.rent_demonstration.text"
msgstr "Tens of thousands take to the streets against rising rents. Should rents be regulated more strictly?"

msgid "event.supplier_closure.name"
msgstr "Supplier closes a plant"

msgid "event.supplier_closure.text"
msgstr "A large car supplier in the South announces the closure of a plant, pointing to the coming combustion engine ban. Thousands of jobs are at stake."

msgid "event.wind_farm_protest.name"
msgstr "Citizens' initiative against a wind farm"

msgid "event.wind_farm_protest.text"
msgstr "In the North, residents block the construction of a large wind farm. The local press wants to know: does the party support expanding wind power?"

msgid "event.wolf_attack.name"
msgstr "Wolf injures child"

msgid "event.wolf_attack.text"
msgstr "On a pasture in the North, a wolf slightly injures a child. The debate about nature conservation boils over."

msgid "institution.bundestag.description"
msgstr "Goal of the MVP: entering the Bundestag with at least 5 %."

msgid "institution.bundestag.name"
msgstr "Bundestag"

msgid "institution.constitutional_court.description"
msgstr "Only matters in later phases."

msgid "institution.constitutional_court.name"
msgstr "Federal Constitutional Court"

msgid "institution.domestic_intelligence.description"
msgstr "Watches the party and raises its classification under high scrutiny."

msgid "institution.domestic_intelligence.name"
msgstr "Domestic intelligence (Verfassungsschutz)"

msgid "land.bb.description"
msgstr "Suburbs and new industry grow around Berlin, while farming and wind farms shape the countryside. Lusatia is in the middle of structural change after the end of coal."

msgid "land.bb.name"
msgstr "Brandenburg"

msgid "land.be.description"
msgstr "The capital is growing fast, and housing is scarce and expensive. Many people work in administration, science and the creative industries; social questions matter a lot."

msgid "land.be.name"
msgstr "Berlin"

msgid "land.bw.description"
msgstr "Mechanical engineering and high technology shape the land; many jobs depend on the car industry and its suppliers. Rents are rising in the cities, and the state budget is considered sound."

msgid "land.bw.name"
msgstr "Baden-Württemberg"

msgid "land.by.description"
msgstr "Besides the car industry and high-tech locations, farming shapes much of the land, and the Alps and lakes attract tourists. Bavaria pays a lot into fiscal equalization and values sound budgets."

msgid "land.by.name"
msgstr "Bavaria"

msgid "land.hb.description"
msgstr "The smallest city state lives on its port and industry. High debt limits its room for manoeuvre, and many households need social support."

msgid "land.hb.name"
msgstr "Bremen"

msgid "land.he.description"
msgstr "Frankfurt is a financial centre and a transport hub; housing is scarce in the Rhine-Main area. Hesse pays into fiscal equalization and keeps an eye on its finances."

msgid "land.he.name"
msgstr "Hesse"

msgid "land.hh.description"
msgstr "The port city is economically strong, but rents have been rising for years. Port and trade depend on good connections to the world."

msgid "land.hh.name"
msgstr "Hamburg"

msgid "land.mv.description"
msgstr "Long coasts, lakes and fields: nature tourism and farming are the main employers. Many young people have moved away, and municipalities depend on support."

msgid "land.mv.name"
msgstr "Mecklenburg-Western Pomerania"

msgid "land.ni.description"
msgstr "The largest farming land with many livestock farms; at the same time tens of thousands of jobs depend on a large carmaker in which the land holds a stake. Wind farms are growing along the coast."

msgid "land.ni.name"
msgstr "Lower Saxony"

msgid "land.nw.description"
msgstr "The most populous land in structural change: coal and steel are losing importance, while large cities and dense mid-sized industry shape the economy. Affordable housing and social security are central issues."

msgid "land.nw.name"
msgstr "North Rhine-Westphalia"

msgid "land.rp.description"
msgstr "Wine growing, mid-sized companies and the chemical industry shape the land, along with many small rural communities."

msgid "land.rp.name"
msgstr "Rhineland-Palatinate"

msgid "land.sh.description"
msgstr "Between two seas, the land produces more wind power than it uses. Tourism and farming are important employers."

msgid "land.sh.name"
msgstr "Schleswig-Holstein"

msgid "land.sl.description"
msgstr "The smallest territorial land lives on car suppliers and steel, both under pressure. High debt limits the land's room for manoeuvre."

msgid "land.sl.name"
msgstr "Saarland"

msgid "land.sn.description"
msgstr "An industrial land with car production and semiconductor manufacturing around Dresden and Leipzig. Many young people leave the countryside, where new wind turbines are disputed."

msgid "land.sn.name"
msgstr "Saxony"

msgid "land.st.description"
msgstr "The chemical industry and farming shape the land. Its population is older on average than elsewhere, and a reliable welfare state matters to many."

msgid "land.st.name"
msgstr "Saxony-Anhalt"

msgid "land.th.description"
msgstr "Mid-sized companies and industry in the cities, much forest and farming in the countryside. The shortage of skilled workers is felt everywhere."

msgid "land.th.name"
msgstr "Thuringia"

